Description: A minimal HMI demo for the Moduline HMI1 (LVGL on KMS)
 Shows a GOcontroll-branded dashboard with live K15/K30 voltages from an
 accompanying Simulink binary, product and hardware information, process
 values, a display-brightness slider and an exit button. Renders with LVGL
 directly on /dev/dri/card1 (no Wayland or X11 compositor), using a
 lightweight, MIT-licensed embedded toolkit.
